sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant H as Host (Osmograph)
    participant F as Firmware (ESP32)
    participant A as ADS1115 x2
    participant M as TCA9548A
    participant S as SHT31
    participant D as Digital sensors
    participant U as OLED

    H->>F: START command (USB-UART)
    F->>U: phase=INTAKE
    Note over F: fan ON 10s sample in
    F->>S: read T and RH at 1 Hz
    F->>U: phase=HOLD
    Note over F: fan OFF 10s equilibrate
    loop sample all channels
        F->>A: ADS1115 ch 0-7 at 8 SPS
        A-->>F: raw reading
    end
    loop each segment 0-7
        F->>M: select channel
        M->>D: transaction
        D-->>F: sensor datum
    end
    F->>U: phase=PURGE
    Note over F: fan ON 20s baseline reset
    F-->>H: JSON record ts phase ao digital t rh
    F->>U: summary complete